{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02685","headline":"荅王无功冬夜载酒乡馆 · 崔善爲","name":"荅王无功冬夜载酒乡馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"颁条忝贵郡，悬榻久相望。\n处士同杨郑，邦君谢李疆。\n讵知方拥篲，逢子敬惟桑。\n明朝蓬户侧，会自谒任棠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔善爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}